[
  {
    "id": "g1",
    "number": 1,
    "titleCz": "Výslovnost a pravopis",
    "titleZh": "發音與拼寫",
    "source": "L1p1",
    "categories": [
      "pronunciation"
    ],
    "bodyHtml": "<p>捷克語一字一音，重音永遠在<b>第一個音節</b>。長音符號 <span class=\"cz-i\">á é í ó ú ů ý</span> 只表示長度，不改變重音位置。</p><div class=\"tscroll\"><table><tr><th>字母</th><th>近似</th><th>例</th></tr><tr><td>c</td><td>ts</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">cukr</span></td></tr><tr><td>č</td><td>ch</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">čeština</span></td></tr><tr><td>ř</td><td>—</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">řeka</span></td></tr></table></div>",
    "relatedWordIds": [
      "w_cestina"
    ]
  },
  {
