  {
    "id": "g4",
    "number": 4,
    "titleCz": "Rod podstatných jmen",
    "titleZh": "名詞的性",
    "source": "L1p2",
    "categories": [
      "case-1"
    ],
    "bodyHtml": "<p>捷克語名詞分四類：陽性有生命、陽性無生命、陰性、中性。判斷主要看第 1 格字尾。</p><div class=\"tscroll\"><table><tr><th>性</th><th>典型字尾</th><th>例</th></tr><tr><td>M 有生命</td><td>子音</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">student, muž</span></td></tr><tr><td>M 無生命</td><td>子音</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">pokoj, byt</span></td></tr><tr><td>F</td><td>-a, -e, 子音</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">žena, restaurace, kuchyň</span></td></tr><tr><td>N</td><td>-o, -e, -í</td><td><span class=\"cz-i\">město, nádraží</span></td></tr></table></div>",
    "relatedWordIds": [
      "w_student",
