  {
    "id": "g36",
    "number": 36,
    "titleCz": "Jít × chodit, jet × jezdit",
    "titleZh": "移動動詞對",
    "source": "L6",
    "categories": [
      "verb-type",
      "motion-verbs"
    ],
    "bodyHtml": "<p>一次性的移動用 <span class=\"cz-i\">jít / jet</span>；重複、習慣性的移動用 <span class=\"cz-i\">chodit / jezdit</span>。</p><p><span class=\"cz-i\">Teď jdu do školy.</span> 我現在要去學校。／<span class=\"cz-i\">Každý den chodím do školy.</span> 我每天去學校。</p>",
    "relatedWordIds": [
      "w_jit",
      "w_jet",
      "w_chodit",
      "w_jezdit"
    ]
  },
